+# speed2_talk.txt - speed tour 2, S3-TALK: the Talk screen (core/src/talk_scene.c, SCENE_TALK) on the GBA ROM.
+# The same prelude as talk.txt (a house visit first: Talk's opener only plays after one), then `push TALK 1`:
+# windows on the opener's boxes (the dialogue box with the portrait over the screen), the replies list idle and
+# with the cursor moving, the line-saying frame (a quick reply: the drama manager and the generator run), and
+# the answer's boxes. The window rules are in speed2_fair.txt. Seed 18 is pinned: the opener's line count follows it.
